(text "SWITCHES (internal pull-ups)" (at 170.18 218.44 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a9b24626-687d-4564-b6f1-c5757b66063e))
(text "OPERATOR INPUTS (RC-filtered ADC)" (at 20.32 139.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6a16ef48-c597-4a7b-950d-a4a261436a92))
(text "NOTES. A concept drawn by Claude at Bob Drzyzgula's direction, October 2026: not built, not tested, values not checked." (at 20.32 257.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3c488e9e-4ea5-4cde-bcfe-e891375bd423))
(text "1. After Freescale AN1662: zero-cross interrupt sets a timer alarm (or a PIO program); at the firing delay a ~100 us gate pulse fires the" (at 20.32 260.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid da15a7bd-4869-443a-83ff-4ad8d883aa94))
(text "   triac; hand-wheel period from edge timestamps; speed loop every half-cycle (120 Hz); stall watchdog. Added: isolation, relay, inputs." (at 20.32 263.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 48147212-caa5-4dfd-bd86-b5d2839ad9a7))
(text "2. Pins (RP2350B): FIRE GP4; RELAY GP5; ZC GP6; HALL GP7; STITCH GP10; NEEDLE GP12; knee, pedal, FSR, limit on ADC0-3 (GP40-43)," (at 20.32 266.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5175449e-f816-49e6-9b68-6e3bc32b3633))
(text "   ADC4-7 spare; GP8/GP9 UART1 for a debug line (or USB serial). Avoid GP0 (PSRAM select on some boards), GP23, GP25 (key, LED)." (at 20.32 269.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e1f010bd-baae-4a40-b961-604ce23987a3))
(text "3. PS1 feeds VSYS through D2, so USB may stay plugged in (the control side is SELV). Flash by UF2 (BOOTSEL) or SWD. Drive GP4 at 8-12 mA." (at 20.32 273.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5acf6fb4-3d51-4c39-9ecc-aec946db950b))
(text "4. Fire only after a zero-cross has been seen and the command is zero; close K1 last and open it first. Never scope the line side." (at 20.32 276.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6ee99fc4-08f3-4803-b663-ae9cf4d0266e))
(text "5. R7/R8: ~3.9 mA peak in the H11AA1; R11: ~8 mA into U3 from 3.3 V; R6/C2 fitted only if a snubberless triac false-fires." (at 20.32 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9f0e1371-c3aa-481d-a875-6f1b25e1f778))
(text "6. On a WeAct RP2350B Core board, feed PS1 to the 5V pin: the board has its own diode from USB VBUS, so D2 may be left out." (at 20.32 282.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0b3141a2-30e3-4ab0-9d38-9d7d96f032d6))
